    {
      "run": 7,
      "steps": 20,
      "narrative": "In the dimly lit confines of a ship, I, an explorer, navigate through its cramped spaces. Armed with a kettle, coil of rope, brass key, and a logbook, I read the records of the ship's past and examine the mechanics of its equipment, seeking answers to the mystery that brings me here. My journey has led me from the salt-encrusted galley, to the empty store, up the stairwell, and into the glass-enclosed lamp room. In every moment, I strive to uncover the secrets hidden within the ship's walls, driven by an insatiable curiosity that fuels my every step.",
